{"mainQuestId":22009,"title":"A Little Raid","description":"Soraya is fed up with those Treasure Hoarders constantly digging up relics. She's looking for someone who can help put a stop to them once and for all.","titleTextMapHash":57308143,"descTextMapHash":3743558150,"mainQuestExcel":{"mainQuestId":22009,"titleTextMapHash":57308143,"title":"A Little Raid","descTextMapHash":3743558150,"description":"Soraya is fed up with those Treasure Hoarders constantly digging up relics. She's looking for someone who can help put a stop to them once and for all.","chapterId":0,"mainQuestTag":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","activityId":0,"luaPath":"Actor/Quest/IQ22009","mainQuestRaw":{"activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","activityId":0,"chapterId":0,"descTextMapHash":3743558150,"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GMENNHMBBOH":[{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0}],"id":22009,"IELNANBAMLH":"QUEST_PAUSE_RES_DESTROY_NONE","IGHALKGCHAB":1081522761,"LEFIHLHODBM":[],"luaPath":"Actor/Quest/IQ22009","mainQuestTag":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","MHHFFHCLDKI":false,"PEDANLIDLGE":0,"PEFIFLDHPEE":false,"recommendLevel":0,"repeatable":true,"resId":0,"rewardIdList":[],"series":0,"showRedPoint":false,"showType":"QUEST_SHOW","specialShowCondIdList":[],"specialShowQuestId":0,"specialShowRewardId":[],"suggestTrackMainQuestList":[],"suggestTrackOutOfOrder":false,"taskID":26900,"titleTextMapHash":57308143,"type":"IQ","unlockDescTextMapHash":2112896998}},"flow":[{"subQuestId":2200901,"order":1,"stepDescription":"Talk to Soraya","stepDescTextMapHash":1995090812,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2200901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["2211"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[2200901],"talks":[{"talkId":2200901,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","beginCond":[{"param":["2200901","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":2200901,"initDialog":220090101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[2211],"performCfg":"","priority":3,"questId":22009,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":220090101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":2641306034,"text":"These Treasure Hoarders are running more and more rampant...","nextNodeIds":[220090102]},{"nodeId":220090102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1791230170,"text":"You were looking for me?","nextNodeIds":[220090103]},{"nodeId":220090103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":546191090,"text":"Ah, yes. I have a matter to entrust to you. This Bao'er you mentioned previously... After thorough investigation, I have ascertained that she is a Treasure Hoarder.","nextNodeIds":[220090104]},{"nodeId":220090104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":2868133346,"text":"As for the reason why she acted alone... Perhaps she wanted to take all the treasure for herself, or perhaps she was always meant to be a vanguard for the main group of Treasure Hoarders.","nextNodeIds":[220090105]},{"nodeId":220090105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":1717543914,"text":"Judging by how she was able to fool even such an experienced adventurer as yourself, she seems adept at subterfuge as well.","nextNodeIds":[220090106]},{"nodeId":220090106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":3304578642,"text":"If we leave her be, then we also leave the surrounding Treasure Hoarders to run amok. This will put the cultural relics nearby at risk.","nextNodeIds":[220090107]},{"nodeId":220090107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":3473190522,"text":"Therefore, I'd like you to stop them. Even if we cannot rein them in entirely, rescuing some relics from their clutches will serve.","nextNodeIds":[220090108,220090110,220090117]},{"nodeId":220090108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":776229522,"text":"Understood.","nextNodeIds":[220090109]},{"nodeId":220090109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":960448410,"text":"I'll leave it to you, then.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220090110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3745075402,"text":"How do you know where they are?","nextNodeIds":[220090111]},{"nodeId":220090111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":2757802538,"text":"If I'm not mistaken, this group of Treasure Hoarders has been following me.","nextNodeIds":[220090112]},{"nodeId":220090112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":3268563218,"text":"These greedy scoundrels haven't simply been content to have me lead them to some treasure.","nextNodeIds":[220090113]},{"nodeId":220090113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":2894232410,"text":"As long as it's someplace I've been, they will start digging into the ground, thinking to uncover a little something.","nextNodeIds":[220090114]},{"nodeId":220090114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":705548682,"text":"I know where they'll show up, it just takes a bit of thought. But I'm just a scholar. Such matters of logic are simple for me...","nextNodeIds":[220090115]},{"nodeId":220090115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":1062271434,"text":"But combat is something that I'll have to leave to experienced adventurers like you.","nextNodeIds":[220090116]},{"nodeId":220090116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":58616298,"text":"So please, take those relics back from the Treasure Hoarders!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220090117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":297638586,"text":"I'll clean them up.","nextNodeIds":[220090118]},{"nodeId":220090118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":796261138,"text":"Please wait a moment. While I did say you should stop them, I don't mean for you to have a showdown with Bao'er right away.","nextNodeIds":[220090119]},{"nodeId":220090119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":2598054202,"text":"The Treasure Hoarders have a very loose organization, and it's hard to get ahold of their trail. Now that you've gotten tangled up with them, we have the chance of a lifetime.","nextNodeIds":[220090120]},{"nodeId":220090120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":3466613250,"text":"I believe that there's a bigger scheme behind their presence here in the Guili Plains. If you stay near Bao'er, you might be able to uncover those plans.","nextNodeIds":[220090121]},{"nodeId":220090121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":3642134514,"text":"So don't reveal yourself just yet. I trust in your ability to find a hidden point to strike, and to... well, end things quickly.","nextNodeIds":[220090122]},{"nodeId":220090122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":619115226,"text":"Remember, get the relics and get out.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2200901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB"